   "id": "99aab638-57af-44bd-8452-a8980b23801c",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "1\n",
      "{True: 'B'}\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "d = {True: \"A\", 1: \"B\"}\n",
    "print(len(d))\n",
    "print(d)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "13a38571-62d6-4959-9dc2-261cad353dc0",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### Output:\n",
    "- 1\n",
    "- {True: 'B'}\n",
    "#### Explanation: True and 1 are equal in Python so they are treated\n",
    "#### as the same dictionary key\n",
    "#### The value \"B\" replaces the value \"A\" so the dictionary has one key"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "18a73063-760a-4d82-963d-7f44552a1678",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "-------------------"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "674d62c1-13ea-4aa3-ab46-c2e63e1f9dce",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Q.17)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 17,
   "id": "5c147589-6adf-4521-873d-c5d8b5e71480",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "B\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "d = {1: \"A\", True: \"B\"}\n",
    "print(d[True])"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "710d8848-6ba4-4c66-9a75-32aa890ab3d6",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### Output: B\n",
    "#### Explanation: In Python True and 1 are treated as the same key\n",
    "#### The value \"B\" replaces the value \"A\"\n",
    "#### So d[True] prints B"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "3f39ebf5-5e2d-4193-89ba-c7f021973913",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
