   "source": [
    "import copy\n",
    "\n",
    "a = [[1, 2], [3, 4]]\n",
    "b = copy.copy(a)\n",
    "print(a is b)\n",
    "print(a[0] is b[0])"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "7e60f530-eff2-4873-9044-675151ac47d7",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### Output:\n",
    "- False\n",
    "- True\n",
    "#### Explanation: copy() creates a new outer list\n",
    "#### But both lists share the same nested list"
   ]
